# Audio scratch/output files - these are large binary artifacts from
# processing runs, not source. Keep them out of git; use audio_archive/
# or thefixer/uploads|outputs/ on disk instead.
*.wav
*.mp3
*.m4a
*.flac
*.aac
*.ogg
*.aiff
*.aif

.DS_Store

# Local audio libraries, ignored WHOLESALE. The extension rules above already
# catch audio files anywhere, but ignoring the folders themselves means
# anything else dropped in them - artwork, notes, session files, an export in
# a format not listed above - also stays out of the repo. 661MB combined at
# the time of writing; none of it is source.
music/
audio_archive/
